# CR 303.4a, 601.2c: Animate Dead is "Enchant creature card in a graveyard", so
# its legal hosts are cards in graveyards, not permanents (CardState.java:665
# TgtZone$ Battlefield,Graveyard; Card.java:6986 allows a host outside play
# when the Enchant type contains inZone). Grizzly Bears is the only creature
# card there, so it is assigned without a `queue enchanttarget`. On resolution
# the Aura enters attached to the graveyard card; its enters trigger returns
# the creature under the Aura controller's control, swaps the Aura's Enchant
# keyword for "Creature.IsRemembered" and re-attaches it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
